      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Very competitive but hard to go past the in-form WHIPPIN PICCADILLY (5) who has won her last two on en, both over a little further. Best form is this circuit and placed only try this course and distance. Drawn for a nice trail and looks hard to beat. SUSHI EXPRESS (2) was good this class last time over 1380m when crossing from out wide and lifting strongly to finish runner-up. Fitter again for the loner journey now. RUBBLEONTHEDOUBLE (6) has won two of three this time in on the turf but has won here. At top now and expected to go close again. ZEWINNA (4) comes through the same race finishing fourth but best for  is this journey and gets chance to turn the tables. GARCON D'ESPOIR (9) will find this tougher but overdue and weighted to feature.",
